
SWAP(4)             UNIX Programmer's Manual              SWAP(4)

NAME
     swap - swap device

DESCRIPTION
     This file refers to the swap device in use by the system.
     It should be linked to the special file for the disk or disk
     partition on which the system swaps.  It is used by programs
     that wish to read from the swap device without knowing its
     real name.

FILES
     /dev/swap

SEE ALSO
     ps(1), w(1)

